@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF HAPPY BiRTHDAY VERSiON 1.2"

HAPPY BiRTHDAY VERSiON 1.2 iS A TOOL WHiCH LOOKS iF A USER WHO iS
LOGGiNG iN HAS iTS BiRTHDAY. iF YES HE WiLL GAiN SOME SMALL AWARDS
LiKE UPLOAD FiLES OR UPLOAD BYTES.

iT HAS ALSO @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT OTHER TOOLS DOESN'T HAVE.

@ENDNODE

@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF HAPPY BiRTHDAY VERSiON 1.2"

i DECiDED TO CODE THiS SMALL TOOL JUST FOR FUN AND TO MAKE MY BBS
DiFFERENT FROM OTHER BBS'S. A BBS WHiCH TAKES MORE CARE OF iTS USERS
iS MORE WORTH TO CALL THAN OTHER BOARDS.

HAPPY BiRTHDAY VERSiON 1.2 WORKS FULLY WiTH TOOLTYPES iN AN iNFO-FiLE.
iT iS EASY TO iNSTALL AND HAS A NiCE DESiGN.

AND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL
HAPPY BiRTHDAY V1.2 :)

@ENDNODE

@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF HAPPY BiRTHDAY VERSiON 1.2"

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.

@ENDNODE

@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"

TO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR
SYS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.


          11 SPACES iN         
          |
----------------------------------------------------------          
*BDAY    RM001MODULES:MM_TOOLS/HAPPYBiRTHDAY/HAPPYBiRTHDAY
----------------------------------------------------------
||        |||  |           
||        |||  ` 'MODULES:MM_TOOLS/HAPPYBiRTHDAY/HAPPYBiRTHDAY'
||        |||     iS THE LOCATiON OF THE FiLE.
||        |||
||        ||` 001 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT
||        ||      YOU LiKE.
||        ||
||        |` 'M' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS ('S' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).
||        |
||        ` 'R' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE 'REXXDOOR'-UTiL.
||
|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.
|
`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE 'BDAY' & ONLY  'BDAY'
  TO GET THE DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS 'BDAYZ'
  AND 'BDAYSY' WOULD STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.


  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN
  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE
  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN'T KNOW WHAT WAS
  GOiNG ON!)  

  NOW COPY THE 'OBJTEXT'-COMMAND FROM THE UTiLS-DiRECTORY OF THE
  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO BBS:UTiLS/.

  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY 'MODULES' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.

  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF 'HAPPYBiRTHDAY.iNFO'. YOU
  WiLL FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/HAPPYBiRTHDAY/'.

  THE VERY LAST THiNG TO DO iS TO CHECK iF YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWiNG
  COMMANDS iN YOUR C-DiRECTORY (COZ HAPPY BiRTHDAY V1.2 WiLL NEED
  SOME OF THEM).

  C:DELETE
  C:COPY

  NOW ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR

  --------------CUT HERE----------------
  ~CC_BDAY
  --------------CUT HERE----------------

 
  THAT'S ALL...

@ENDNODE

