@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"

  USER.<number>=<name>                   THE <number> DEFiNES THE NUMBER
                                         OF THE USER. THE <name> DEFiNES
                                         THE NAME OF THE USER WHiCH HAS
                                         iTS BiRTHDAY AT A SPECiAL DATE.

                                         E.G.: USER.01=MuMu
                                               USER.02=MURDOC
                                               USER.03=PAUL

  DATE.<number>=<date>                   THE <number> DEFiNES THE NUMBER
                                         OF THE USER. THE <date> DEFiNES
                                         THE DATE ON WHiCH THE USER WiTH
                                         THE NUMBER DEFiNED iN
                                         USER.<number>=<name> HAS iTS
                                         BiRTHDAY.

                                         E.G.: DATE.01=23 May

                                         !!! ATTENTiON !!

                                         HERE ARE THE SHORTSCUTS FOR EACH
                                         MONTH:

                                         JANUARY    =   Jan 
                                         FEBRUARY   =   Feb
                                         MARCH      =   Mar
                                         APRiL      =   Apr
                                         MAY        =   May
                                         JUNE       =   Jun
                                         JULY       =   Jul
                                         AUGUST     =   Aug
                                         SEPTEMBER  =   Sep
                                         OCTOBER    =   Oct
                                         NOVEMBER   =   Nov
                                         DECEMBER   =   Dec

                                         
  FiLES.<number1>=<number2>              THE <number1> DEFiNES THE NUMBER
                                         OF THE USER. THE <number2> DEFiNES
                                         THE AMOUNT OF UPLOAD FiLES THE USER
                                         WiTH THE <number> DEFiNED iN THE
                                         DATE.<number>=<date> GAiNS.


  BYTES.<number1>=<number2>              THE <number1> DEFiNES THE NUMBER
                                         OF THE USER. THE <number2> DEFiNES
                                         THE AMOUNT OF UPLOAD BYTES THE USER
                                         WiTH THE <number> DEFiNED iN THE
                                         DATE.<number>=<date> GAiNS.

  EXAMPLE .iNFO:

  USER.01=MuMu     
  DATE.01=23 May   
  FiLES.01=30      
  BYTES.01=3000000 
  USER.02=qUASiMODO
  DATE.02=17 Dec  
  FiLES.02=15     
  BYTES.02=5000000


  THAT SHOULD BE ALL FOR NOW...


@ENDNODE       

